          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "runspeccounty_rows"
          ],
          "description": "runspeccounty.countyID. The one runspec selection this document did not carry, because `link` arrived pre-selected: an execution database's `link` holds the run's links and nothing else, so summing a column of it WAS reading it. The default database's `Link` is national, and the four equations below now say which row they mean.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "db_runspeccounty",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "countyID"
            }
          }
        },
