        "run_baseYearIsAnalysisYear": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "run_rows"
          ],
          "description": "S1: is 2020 flagged as a base year? It is, so §1.5's population and VMT folds are the empty product and finding F12 does not arise. A run whose analysis year is not a base year needs both folds; this document takes the collapsed form and says so here (docs/esm-conventions.md §15)."
