          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "sourcetypeage_rows"
          ],
          "description": "S3's denominator is assembled on the 533-row (source type, age) relation because that is the SMALL side of the join to the 33,579-row distribution (finding F17)."
